The DUCKY_LANG/default-layout implementation was prepared as a modification of
that GPL-licensed application. Standalone UI changes replace firmware-internal
icons with text/empty visuals so the external app can be built with the public
uFBT SDK. This is an independent community app, not an official Flipper Devices
release. The exact tested source baseline for this standalone package is the
Flipper firmware 1.5.1 release source; the original Hybridus/Unleashed build is a
separate API 88.27 artifact and is not this package.
